<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 102,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 102,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's actual receipts 102,000 head at interior Iowa/so Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales of barrows and gilts $0.50 to $1.00 higher than mid-session Thursday. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   County		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.50 -55.50	   55.50 -56.50</p>
<p>few			54.00  56.00	   55.00  57.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -44.00	   42.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -46.00	   43.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -49.00</p>
